Package: autozyme
Type: Package
Title: Drop-in Accelerators for Scientific R Packages
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Elliot", family = "Xie",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xie227@wisc.edu")
Author: Elliot Xie [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Elliot Xie <xie227@wisc.edu>
Description: A registry of validated, monkey-patched fast replacements for hot
 functions in scientific R packages (Seurat, nichenetr, slingshot, etc.).
 Patches are auto-injected on package load when the corresponding upstream
 is installed, and can be toggled per-call (zyme = FALSE), per-package
 (deactivate("name")), or globally (deactivate_all() / AUTOZYME_DISABLED env var).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://autozyme.com, https://github.com/ElliotXie/autozyme
BugReports: https://github.com/ElliotXie/autozyme/issues
